# 18.14 Summary

The `documents` table serves as the authoritative metadata layer for every knowledge asset within KnowledgeOS.

By separating immutable source files, structured metadata, AI-generated artifacts, and vector representations, the design provides a scalable, secure, and AI-native foundation. Rich metadata, lifecycle tracking, cached analytics, and extensible processing states ensure that documents integrate seamlessly with the RAG pipeline, conversational AI, insights engine, and future platform capabilities while maintaining strict user isolation and high retrieval performance.

